            Watch how Zentro AI transforms natural language into fully functional websites with a chat-based interface.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Video Container -->
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <div class="relative group">
            <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 via-red-600 to-rose-600 rounded-2xl opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-30 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500 animate-pulse-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-border bg-card shadow-2xl">
              
